cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated article."
title: "pv-dimensionality-reduction: filter/wrapper diagnostics for endogenous PV power forecasting"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code for short-term photovoltaic power forecasting from the
  post-inverter signal alone (no exogenous meteorological inputs), framed as a
  geometric compression of a lagged-power window. Seven dimensionality-reduction
  techniques are assessed with two complementary diagnostics: a model-free
  filter (geometry preservation) and a wrapper based on an Extreme Learning
  Machine, all reported against a shared accuracy-frugality trade-off.
